  "source": {
    "format": "ssmd",
    "text": "---\nssmd_version: \"0.9\"\ntitle: Renderer-neutral SSMD 0.9 contract\nlanguage: sr-Latn\nvoice_bindings:\n  narrator: provider-voice\nvoice_defaults:\n  narrator:\n    rate: slow\n    volume: soft\nprosody_transitions:\n  enabled: true\n  same_voice_only: true\n  rate: 100ms\npause_defaults:\n  paragraph: 450ms\nlanguage_detection:\n  mode: auto\n  languages: [sr-Latn, en-GB]\nrequires:\n  extensions:\n    - acme.effects.whisper\n---\n# Main heading\n\n:::{voice=\"narrator\" voice-name=\"Mira\" voice-languages=\"sr-Latn\" gender=\"female\" age=\"30\" variant=\"2\" rate=\"medium\" pitch=\"low\"}\nWelcome [reader]{lang=\"sr-Latn\"}.\n:::\n:::{voice=\"narrator\"}\n[Important]{emphasis=\"strong\"} [31.12.2024]{as=\"date\" format=\"dd.mm.yyyy\" detail=\"1\"}, [H2O]{sub=\"water\"}, and [computer]{ph=\"kəmˈpjuːtər\" alphabet=\"ipa\"}.\nA [sound]{src=\"door.wav\" desc=\"door chime\" clip=\"1s-2s\" speed=\"110%\" repeat=\"1.5\" level=\"-3dB\"} plays, followed by [whisper]{ext=\"acme.effects.whisper\" mode=\"soft\"}.\n:::\n::::{voice=\"narrator\" rate=\"medium\" pitch=\"low\"}\nOuter scope establishes block prosody.\n:::{rate=\"fast\" pitch=\"high\"}\nInner scope preserves explicit rate and pitch.\n:::\nBack in the outer voice scope.\n::::\n\nA pause ...500ms then a marker. @checkpoint\n\n## Secondary heading\n\nAfter the heading.\n"
  },
  "texts": {
    "spoken": "Main heading\n\nWelcome reader. Important 31.12.2024, H2O, and computer. A sound plays, followed by whisper. Outer scope establishes block prosody.\n\nInner scope preserves explicit rate and pitch.\n\nBack in the outer voice scope.\n\nA pause then a marker.\n\nSecondary heading\n\nAfter the heading.",
